-----

To restore the full homepage at any time, run this one command in the terminal: 

cp client/src/pages/Dashboard.backup.tsx client/src/pages/Dashboard.tsx

That's it — the full homepage with hashrate cards, asset list, trending coins, charts, news, etc. will be back instantly.
